      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "何かごめん"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910160,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ずっと連続で、その……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "大丈夫だった？"
