    {
      "Id": 100910420,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Right"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910430,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "It's really late now though. Did you make it home okay?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910440,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "You went straight home, right? I was worried."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910450,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": ""
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910460,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Stop worrying so much."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910470,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "That answers your question, right?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910480,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Well, it IS late..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910490,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Night, Sensei."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910500,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Hey, Sensei. I was wondering."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910510,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "You free later, by chance?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910520,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I think so. What's up?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910530,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "For what? Are you treating me?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910540,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Nothing really."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910550,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "...Yeah."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910560,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I've just gotten a lot from you, you know? I wanted to repay you at least a little."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910570,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Let me know when's good for you."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910580,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "We'll meet up at the usual spot."
    },
    {
      "Id": 100910590,
      "Speaker": "Student",
